WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:04.909
Oh, what a cute little puppy.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:06.319
Oh, thank you.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:07.510
So much energy.

00:00:07.511 --> 00:00:09.289
That's why I got the longer leash.

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:10.290
Go.

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:17.070
Got him.

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:20.749
I could climb that wall over.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:21.709
Please stop.

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:22.759
Ride that elephant.

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:24.379
Dude, you're embarrassing yourself.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:25.519
You think I won't?

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:26.479
It's time to go home.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:27.409
I could fight a monkey.

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:28.639
Pack it in, man.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:29.719
I'll fight that monkey.

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.129
That's over right there.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:31.939
Dumbo can take him.

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:33.379
Just go home.

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.669
I'll bet you $10.

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:35.959
I'll go in there. Beat up that

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:36.960
monkey. Get him.

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:56.889
One frozen cherry tart.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:57.369
Please.

00:00:57.370 --> 00:00:59.079
Sure. You want the four-inch tart or

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:00.279
the six-inch tart.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:01.629
I'm so sorry.

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:04.149
You wearing a wire, you rat?

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:04.929
They made me do it.

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:05.930
They made me do it.

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:12.520
Got him. Yeah.

